window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c357-949321eb99c30d70.json"]={sha256:"949321eb99c30d706a7f146b4fbd0ed932b6f6f932aa3d0cfd5999106958782b",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-29f9c9d0f9cba99d","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-2020-perseverance/","title":"Perseverance Mars rover — NASA Science","titleEn":"Perseverance Mars rover — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c357","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c357","related":[{"id":"c358","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-2020-perseverance/ingenuity-mars-helicopter/"],"title":"Ingenuity 火星直升機","titleEn":"Ingenuity Mars helicopter","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：本課以全完整機率 0.95 作教學目標，並要求不存在孤兒鍵；機率通過不能取代實際核對。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Use 0.95 all-complete probability as a teaching target and require no orphan keys; probability does not replace an actual audit. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"以理想致動盤模型估算懸停誘導功率，識別實機功耗中被忽略的項目。","differenceEn":"Estimate hover induced power with an ideal actuator disk and identify omitted real power demands.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學資料集 20 支樣管，每管中繼資料缺漏機率 0.01。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：P全完整=(1−0.01)^20。 結果約 0.817907 fraction。若每管獨立遺失必要中繼資料的機率為 p，n 管全部完整的機率為 (1−p)^n；共因故障會破壞獨立性。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成重量 W=6 N、大氣密度 ρ=0.02 kg/m³、有效盤面 A=1 m²；盤面不重複加算。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：Pi=6^1.5/sqrt(2×0.02×1)。 結果約 73.4847 W。理想懸停 Pi=W^(3/2)/sqrt(2ρA)；不含槳剖面阻力、機械損失與非均勻入流。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use a synthetic set of 20 tubes and per-tube metadata loss probability 0.01. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Pall-complete=(1−0.01)^20. Result ≈ 0.817907 fraction. With independent per-tube metadata loss probability p, all n complete has probability (1−p)^n; common-cause faults invalidate independence.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic W=6 N, density 0.02 kg/m³ and effective disk area 1 m² without double-counting overlapping disks. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Pi=6^1.5/sqrt(2×0.02×1). Result ≈ 73.4847 W. Ideal hover Pi=W^(3/2)/sqrt(2ρA), excluding profile drag, mechanical loss and nonuniform inflow.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c367","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/dawn/"],"title":"Dawn 小行星帶探測","titleEn":"Dawn asteroid-belt mission","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：本課以全完整機率 0.95 作教學目標，並要求不存在孤兒鍵；機率通過不能取代實際核對。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Use 0.95 all-complete probability as a teaching target and require no orphan keys; probability does not replace an actual audit. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"把工作週期及質量近似帶入低推力速度增量估算。","differenceEn":"Include duty cycle and a mass approximation in a low-thrust velocity-increment estimate.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學資料集 20 支樣管，每管中繼資料缺漏機率 0.01。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：P全完整=(1−0.01)^20。 結果約 0.817907 fraction。若每管獨立遺失必要中繼資料的機率為 p，n 管全部完整的機率為 (1−p)^n；共因故障會破壞獨立性。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成推力 0.08 N、質量 800 kg、日曆時間 10 日、工作率 0.75。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：Δv=0.08×10×86400×0.75/800。 結果約 64.8 m/s。短期質量近似固定時 Δv=F×工作時間/m；長期需積分變質量與方向。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use a synthetic set of 20 tubes and per-tube metadata loss probability 0.01. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Pall-complete=(1−0.01)^20. Result ≈ 0.817907 fraction. With independent per-tube metadata loss probability p, all n complete has probability (1−p)^n; common-cause faults invalidate independence.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic thrust is 0.08 N, mass 800 kg, calendar span ten days and duty fraction 0.75. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Δv=0.08×10×86400×0.75/800. Result ≈ 64.8 m/s. With nearly fixed short-term mass, Δv=F×active time/m; long intervals require variable-mass and directional integration.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-6d6c5f9590a03bf4","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-2020-perseverance/ingenuity-mars-helicopter/","title":"Ingenuity Mars helicopter — NASA Science","titleEn":"Ingenuity Mars helicopter — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-b16c38d0c3e3ea03","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/dawn/","title":"Dawn asteroid-belt mission — NASA Science","titleEn":"Dawn asteroid-belt mission — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
